MINI PROJECT 2

Project Title: DIGITAL PLATFORM ANALYTICS: EXPLORING USER INTERACTION AND SOCIAL MEDIA BEHAVIOR


Project Description:
 Social media platforms generate large volumes of data through user posts, likes, comments, shares, saves, views, and other interactions. Analysing this data can help identify engagement patterns, platform performance, content effectiveness, audience 
sentiment, and influencer behaviour. This project addresses these challenges by transforming raw social media records into structured business intelligence using Power BI and Tableau to 
evaluate platform-wise engagement, content-type performance, sentiment patterns, influencer-tier engagement, monthly trends, and individual post performance. 

